# Claude Code: everything under .claude is local state, at any depth.
# Skills are the exception, they are shared so contributors get them from the
# repo instead of needing them installed globally. Glob the contents rather
# than the directory itself, git cannot re-include a path whose parent is
# excluded.
**/.claude/*
!**/.claude/skills/

# Superpowers plans/specs - local working docs, never committed (all packages)
**/docs/superpowers/

# Superpowers execution workspace: per-plan ledgers, briefs, review packages - scratch, never committed
.superpowers/

# local test credentials (never committed)
.env.test
**/.env.test

# Syncthing conflict artifacts
*.sync-conflict-*

# Velite build artifact for the docs content. The docs app itself moved out
# (6bf78c7a), leaving a 7.6MB prebuilt JSON checked in as the only copy of 20
# pages of pre-rename API - unreviewable, and wrong. Never track it again.
.velite/
**/.velite/
